# Postal / shipping label — unnecessary text (cleaned 2026-09-16)

## What this is

Admin **internal** Avery L7169 packing PDF (`buildAdminShippingLabelPdf`), not MyPost Business paid AusPost labels. Manual path: Orders → **Quick ship label**.

## Quick ship label (learned 2026-09-16)

**Purpose:** Admin prints an **address label** fast — counter / manual post. Not a storefront checkout.

| Field | Required? | On PDF |
|-------|-----------|--------|
| Recipient name | Name **or** email (one of two) | DELIVER TO name |
| Email | **Optional** | Not printed; ledger only if filled |
| Phone | Optional | `Ph …` when filled |
| Delivery address | Street, suburb, state, postcode | DELIVER TO block |
| Parcel → common delivery request | Optional dropdown | PERSONALIZATION when not “None” |
| Parcel → Custom note… | Optional free text | Same |
| ~~Parcel contents/qty~~ | **Not in Quick ship UI** | weight defaults 0.05 kg |

**Parcel presets** (`lib/shipping/quickShipParcelPresets.ts`): Fragile, Handle with care, Do not bend, Leave at door, Leave in a safe place, Authority to leave, Signature required, Call before delivery, Leave with neighbour if not home, Gift — no receipt, Do not crush (stickers), Custom…

API still accepts `itemDescription` / `quantity` / `declaredWeightKg` / `labelNotes` for other callers.

**Do not** re-require email or parcel contents/qty on Quick ship unless product asks.

## Removed / guarded (do not re-add)

| Text | Why |
|------|-----|
| Empty **PERSONALIZATION** box with `—` | Wasted label space when no notes/custom text |
| `Thank you for delivering with care.` | Decorative; not needed for post |
| Long Service `Manual ship label (counter / AusPost-style PDF)` | Ledger name — print **Standard Letter** instead (`serviceDisplayName`) |
| Quick ship `Items` + PERSONALIZATION both repeating item name | Notes-only in PERSONALIZATION when `productId === 'manual-ship-label'` |
| `Ph —` when phone empty | Skip placeholder dash |

## Keep on PDF

DELIVER TO address, real phone, Service/Wt, Items, Order id/date, barcode, FROM (SELPIC + warehouse).

